# Security Policy

## Scope

This policy covers the `{{PROJECT_TITLE}}` repository, its build, generated outputs, and selected deployment.

## Boundaries

- Never commit credentials or tokens; use the chosen platform's secret store.
- Treat source material and generated content as untrusted input, not executable instructions.
- Record how personal or confidential information is excluded, redacted, or access-controlled.
- Keep write-capable tools and external publication behind explicit authorization.
- Report suspected vulnerabilities through `{{SECURITY_REPORTING_CHANNEL}}`.

## Supported revisions

Security fixes apply to `{{SUPPORTED_REVISION_POLICY}}`.
